{"title":"Silver Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 20) · Monster drop: Gaunt Ogre, Ogre Shaman, Ogre Butcher, Ogre Mauler, Ogre +7 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · STR 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 20 <span class=\"muted\">(549 XP)</span> from 4× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Normal, 3.9% of recorded drops (78 / 1,996 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3.9%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - Normal, 0.8% of recorded drops (11 / 1,303 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/56cd267034ceeafbeb26.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.8%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - Normal, 3.6% of recorded drops (7 / 197 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3.6%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - Normal, 2.3% of recorded drops (4 / 177 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2.3%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+8 more\">+8 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre\" title=\"Ogre - Normal, 7.5% of recorded drops (3 / 40 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ec5ecde5e79f4b9bd162.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">7.5%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Elite, 7.7% of recorded drops (2 / 26 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">7.7%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"gaunt-ogre\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Normal, 8.3% of recorded drops (2 / 24 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9f79b7b3207b320356f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8.3%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - Elite, 4.2% of recorded drops (1 / 24 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/56cd267034ceeafbeb26.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4.2%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (1 / 601 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - Elite, 3.4% of recorded drops (1 / 29 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data